{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/d13c41d1c16d1f786649e00bffecdb86.poster.avif?t=1759477198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/d13c41d1c16d1f786649e00bffecdb86.webm?t=1759477198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/d13c41d1c16d1f786649e00bffecdb86.mp4?t=1759477198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2.5D top-down, roguelike shooter set in a base that has been taken over by a revolt of robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/c1b9c3d3004b98476ddf6b20686209c8.poster.avif?t=1759477198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/c1b9c3d3004b98476ddf6b20686209c8.webm?t=1759477198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/c1b9c3d3004b98476ddf6b20686209c8.mp4?t=1759477198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike gameplay, with a different map with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various guns can be picked up in the base. Make use of their features and plan your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no reloading or refilling ammunition. Even if you don't have a gun, you can utilize a beam knife for close quarter combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike twin-stick shooters, your weapon automatically aims at the enemy when within range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're invincible while dashing. Use this to dodge enemy bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire random gear to upgrade the protagonist. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save up money to buy guns and gear at the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you fight a boss, you can unlock a practice mode for them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are unlockable elements that can be carried over in easy and normal game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In expert mode, there are no carry over elements at all. Use only your skills as a player to break your enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/615eb56651e1b77c31e860eb2faacfa8.poster.avif?t=1759477198\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/615eb56651e1b77c31e860eb2faacfa8.webm?t=1759477198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/615eb56651e1b77c31e860eb2faacfa8.mp4?t=1759477198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is recommended to be played with a controller.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/1eb330ebb6575a5790858ad5292ec765.poster.avif?t=1759477198\" width=310 height=197 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap